<title>INDIA: India sets higher 1997/98 LPG output target.</title>
<headline>India sets higher 1997/98 LPG output target.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's state-run Gas Authority of India Ltd (GAIL) said on Monday it has set a liquified petroleum gas (LPG) production target of 652,366 tonnes in 1997/98 (April-March) compared with 543,570 in 1996/97.</p>
<p>GAIL said in a statement an agreement on the production target was signed between GAIL and the Petroleum Ministry on Monday.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
